Z||000002||Cooter||02-14-2001||05:54 PM||||Anthony- without meaning to, you have opened a bucket of worms. There are a few subjects that get a lot of heated tempers, and you picked one  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><BR>BTW the others are: God and religion, favorite spark plugs, which oil is best, where to get your oil changed and of course removing a cat. converter. <BR>Back to the question- For performance, maybe not. Never having to buy another air filter, a definate yes.<P>------------------<BR>Just because you can't do it doesn't mean it can't be done.||||reg||9
