Z||000004||anthony_86gt||02-14-2001||06:00 PM||||thanks guys.  i didnt mean to raise any problems!  thats all i wanted to know  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||7
Z||000005||terryk||02-14-2001||06:23 PM||||If you want better flow, get rid of the water trap in the fender first, then a K&N. I did some flow tests with my 3800 SC and the water trap is clearly the big problem. The improvement on flow from the K&N over an AC Delco filter was marginal. The Y support for the rod likely cuts it back a bit too.||||reg||1
Z||000006||KnightRyder31||02-14-2001||06:23 PM||||Go K&N. More airflow, more power.<P>||||reg||1
